//　無言、無音の非難を感じる。

//　いくぶん冷静さを取り戻した。
//　状況適応は情報収集の基本とはいえ、適応し過ぎか。
  A wave of silent disapproval washes over me.

  This helps me regain some modicum of sanity. Blending in may be essential to our mission, but this is taking it too far.

